Dozens of activity types
Route planning
iPhone and Android app
Upload your own tracks', 'Туристи, велосипедисти, бігуни й усі, хто шукає маршрути на природі.', 'Hikers, cyclists, runners and anyone looking for outdoor routes.', 'web,mobile', 'none', 'published', 0, 'found', @uid, '2026-10-04 00:00:00' FROM DUAL WHERE @new = 1;
